const ticks = new EventSource('/ticks')
ticks.onmessage = (event) => console.log(event.lastEventId, event.data)
ticks.addEventListener('error', (event) => {
  if (!event.data) {
    console.warn('EventSource transport error; the browser may reconnect')
    return
  }
  const failure = JSON.parse(event.data)
  if (failure.code === 'TY2107' && failure.request_id) {
    console.error('Tachyon stream failed', failure.request_id)
  }
})

